            <ArticleTitle>Invited commentary: recommendation for a north american pediatric patch test series.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>444</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s11882-014-0444-6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Given the increased recognition of pediatric allergic contact dermatitis and lack of patch testing consensus in children, we present a minimum basic 20-allergen North American pediatric series, for screening children ages 6-12 with suspected contact allergy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
